        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-6632, 18 Inch Newbury Collection Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18 Inch Newbury Collection Door Pull has a simple, timeless design that allows it to blend seamlessly into any decor. It is available in beautiful finishes, just click on the picture to the right to see them all. The Newbury Collection Pull has a 18 inch center to center length. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware for a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-131\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-newbury-collection-door-pull-rk-international-ph-6631\"><b>12\" Newbury Door Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 18\" Newbury Collection Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "18 Inch Newbury Door Pull",
                "description": "The 18 Inch Newbury Collection Door Pull has a simple, timeless design that allows it to blend seamlessly into any decor. It is available in beautiful finishes, just click on the picture to the right to see them all. The Newbury Collection Pull has a 18 inch center to center length. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware for a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).",
